OL,3,ABanks say Healey planning to increase
OL,4,Atax on their profits in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior banking executives have told the
OL,7,FBBC they expect the sector to be "on
OL,8,Fthe menu" when the chancellor announces
OL,9,Fhis Budget in two weeks' time.
OL,11,FJohn Healey has described the banks as
OL,12,Fpart of "the crown jewels" of the UK
OL,13,Feconomy, yet has refused to rule out
OL,14,Fraising taxes on the sector.
OL,16,FThe biggest four banks collectively
OL,17,Fmade around #15bn profit in the first
OL,18,Fsix months of this year, leading to
OL,19,Fcalls from trade unions and others for
OL,20,Fadditional taxes.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
